    <content type="html">&lt;h2&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://github.com/openai/openai-python/compare/v3.28.0...v3.29.0&quot;&gt;3.29.0&lt;/a&gt; (2026-10-11)&lt;/h2&gt;
